Diploma thesis
==============

The topic of the thesis is "Towards a Faster FFT-Accelerated Full-Wave Solver
and Its Integration into Shape Optimization Strategies".

Building
--------

Requires make and tectonic (https://tectonic-typesetting.github.io).

* Build everything: make
* Build the thesis: make thesis
* Build the assignment: make assigment
* Remove the outputs: make clean

Each PDF is written to out/<assigment|thesis>/main.pdf.
